cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, code, or analysis in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Italienation: A Data-Driven Study of Italian NEETs, Educational Tracking, and Socioeconomic Exclusion"
authors:
  - family-names: "Eugenix94"
    given-names: "Author"
    alias: "Eugenix94"
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive, data-first repository and comparative empirical study of Italian NEETs (Not in Education, Employment, or Training), early school leavers, tripartite secondary education tracking (Liceo vs. Tecnico/Professionale), and macroeconomic stagnation. This repository integrates structured micro-data (textbook prices, INVALSI school outcomes, regional tuition rates) and international policy benchmarks (OECD, Eurostat, World Bank) to analyze structural barriers to higher education and social mobility in Italy.
keywords:
  - NEET
  - Italy
  - Education Tracking
  - Social Exclusion
  - Early School Leavers
  - VET
  - ISTAT
  - Eurostat
  - OECD
  - Social Mobility
license: MIT
